                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 60:32",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 60,
        "verse": 32
      },
      {
        "text": "Ye know that ye do transgress the laws of God, and ye do know that ye do trample them under your feet. Behold, the Lord saith unto me: If those whom ye have appointed your governors do not repent of their sins and iniquities, ye shall go up to battle against them.",
        "footNotes": [
